sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Owner
  participant I as Stock Overview
  participant G as New Gallons or Seals
  participant H as Movement History
  participant L as Borrowed Gallons
  participant S as Server
  O->>I: 1: Open Inventory
  I->>S: 2: GET /api/inventory
  S-->>I: 3: Stock, low-stock warnings
  O->>I: 4: Tap New Gallons or Seals
  I->>G: 5: Open the item (current stock, entries)
  alt Add stock
    O->>G: 6: Add stock, quantity, note
    G->>S: 7: POST /api/inventory/{item}/add
  else Damaged or lost
    O->>G: 8: Damaged or Lost, quantity, reason
    G->>S: 9: POST /api/inventory/{item}/remove
  end
  S-->>G: 10: New stock, entry added
  O->>I: 11: Tap Movement History
  I->>H: 12: Open Movement History, Filter by item, date or reason
  O->>I: 13: Tap Borrowed Gallons
  I->>L: 14: Open Borrowed Gallons (Borrowed, Returned)
  O->>L: 15: Lend gallon or Mark returned
  L->>S: 16: POST /api/loans or /api/loans/{id}/return
